+  ! ---- Phase 6 prototype: batched wrap of B walkers (env ALF_GPU_WB=B, default off; ALF_GPU_WB_MODE 1 strided batch both sides,
+  !      2 wide gemm left + strided right, 3 separate gemms (control); ALF_GPU_WB_TIME=1 prints wrap timers).  See docs/.../p6/DESIGN.md.
